        "sid": "JER 41"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "41",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi ngenyanga yesikhombisa uIshmayeli indodana kaNethaniya, kaElishama, owenzalo yenkosi, wafika lamadoda alitshumi kuGedaliya indodana kaAhikamu eMizipa. Kwathi besadla laye eMizipa,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.25.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kho 25:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uIshmayeli indodana kaNethaniya lamadoda alitshumi ayelaye bamgwaza ngomkhonto uGedaliya indodana kaAhikamu, kaShafani, bambulala, yena inkosi yaseBabiloni eyayimbeke ukuba ngumbusi elizweni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UIshmayeli wabulala labo bonke abaJuda ababeloGedaliya eMizipa, kanye lamabutho amaKaladiya ayekhona lapho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngosuku lwesibili sebembulele uGedaliya, kungakaziwa muntu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kwafika amadoda angamatshumi aficaminwembili evela eShekema leShilo leSamariya, ephucile indevu zawo, lezigqoko zawo zidatshuliwe, lemizimba yawo isikiwe, eletha iminikelo yempuphu kanye lempepha ukuyinikela ethempelini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UIshmayeli indodana kaNethaniya wasuka eMizipa ukuwahlangabeza, ehamba ekhala. Kwathi lapho ehlangana lawo, wathi kuwo: Wozani kuGedaliya indodana kaAhikamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi esengenile emzini, uIshmayeli indodana kaNethaniya lamadodana ayelaye bawabulala, bawaphosela emgodini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa kwakulamadoda alitshumi phakathi kwawo athi kuIshmayeli: Ungasibulali, ngoba sileziphala ezigcwele amabele ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " lamafutha kanye lenyosi, sikufihlile egangeni. Ngakho wawayekela, kaze awabulala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umgodi uIshmayeli ayephosele kuwo izidumbu zabo bonke abantu ayebabulele, wawungumgodi omkhulu owawenziwe yinkosi uAsa ukuzivikela kuBahasha inkosi yakoIsrayeli. UIshmayeli indodana kaNethaniya wawugcwalisa ngezidumbu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UIshmayeli wasethumba bonke abantu ababesele eMizipa, amadodakazi enkosi labo bonke ababesele eMizipa, uNebuzaradani induna yabalindi ayebanikezele kuGedaliya indodana kaAhikamu. UIshmayeli indodana kaNethaniya wabathumba, wabasa kumaAmoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa kwathi lapho uJohanani indodana kaKareya lazo zonke induna zamabutho ezazilaye besizwa konke okubi okwenziwe nguIshmayeli indodana kaNethaniya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bathatha abantu babo bonke, bayakulwa loIshmayeli. Bamfica echibini elikhulu eliseGibeyoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi lapho bonke abantu ababeloIshmayeli bebona uJohanani indodana kaKareya lazo zonke induna zempi ezazilaye bathokoza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basebephenduka abantu bonke uIshmayeli ayebathumbe eMizipa, babuya baya kuJohanani indodana kaKareya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa uIshmayeli indodana kaNethaniya waphunyuka kuJohanani lamadoda aficaminwembili, wabalekela kumaAmoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJohanani indodana kaKareya lazo zonke induna zamabutho ezazilaye bathatha bonke abantu ababesele uIshmayeli indodana kaNethaniya ayebathumbe eMizipa, esebulele uGedaliya indodana kaAhikamu, amadoda empi, labafazi, labantwana, labathenwa, labo uJohanani ayebuyele labo eGibeyoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basuka bayahlala eGeruthi‐Kimihamu eduze leBetlehema, bezama ukuya eGibithe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bebalekela amaKaladiya; ngoba babewesaba, ngoba uIshmayeli kaNethaniya wayebulele uGedaliya indodana kaAhikamu, inkosi yaseBabiloni eyayimbekile ukuba ngumbusi zelizwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
